# The trial of pod-derp in podssh (T-031; calls C606 to C609), at podssh's
# main b9c04657 (pod-derp.commit), where podssh froze src/derp/ for the move
# (its T-684, Q101). podssh-relay's src/derp/ becomes glue over pod-derp
# (src/derp.rs: podssh's Say, its names, its way out by a ProxyChoice and
# its variables); podssh-cli and podssh-iroh take the stand-in of pod-derp
# (feature standin); the tests derp_link, derp_live, derp_main_live, the
# stand-in, derp-main-live.yml and the plant t449 leave podssh. Each
# podcrates tag moves to v0.50.0. The record with its citations, the
# repository checks; no moved file and no copy of the road's wire stays;
# the build, the bans and the sources of cargo-deny; pod-derp in the tree;
# clippy of the changed crates with the lints that the gate allows; the
# tests of the relay role's DERP server, of the node of the DERP road, of
# the command line's DERP road and of a node found by its record; rustfmt
# of the changed crates; each Rust toolchain of the workflows against the
# rust-version of podcrates; each test target that the gate names.
cargo run -q -p podssh-todo -- remap Cargo.lock > /dev/null
cargo run -q -p podssh-todo -- check
python3 scripts/check-repo.py
test ! -e crates/podssh-relay/src/derp && test ! -e crates/podssh-relay/tests/derp_stand_in && test ! -e crates/podssh-relay/tests/derp_link.rs && test ! -e .github/workflows/derp-main-live.yml
! grep -rn --include='*.rs' -e 'b"pdl1"' -e 'podssh derp key, version 1' crates
! grep -rn --include=Cargo.toml -e 'derp = \["dep:crypto_box"\]' crates
cargo build -q
command -v cargo-deny > /dev/null || cargo install -q --locked cargo-deny
cargo deny --locked check bans sources
cargo tree -q -p podssh-relay --features derp -i pod-derp | grep -q '^pod-derp v'
cargo clippy -q --all-targets -p podssh-relay -p podssh-cli --features podssh-relay/derp,podssh-relay/serve,podssh-relay/tox -- -D warnings -A clippy::collapsible_if
cargo clippy -q -p podssh-iroh --features test-relay --test record_roads -- -D warnings -A clippy::collapsible_if
cargo test -q -p podssh-relay --features derp,serve --lib serve::derp
cargo test -q -p podssh-cli --lib node_derp
cargo test -q -p podssh-cli --test derp_road
cargo test -q -p podssh-iroh --features test-relay --test record_roads
cargo fmt -p podssh-relay -p podssh-cli -p podssh-iroh --check
python3 -I "$PODCRATES/scripts/check-consumer-toolchains.py"
python3 -I "$PODCRATES/scripts/check-consumer-tests.py"
